{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261015/photo/bkn-20261015181048639-1015_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261015181557\"/><p>事發在黃岩島。</p><p>菲律賓軍艦周四（15日）在黃岩島附近海域升空艦載直升機，非法侵入黃岩島的中國領空，中國人民解放軍南部戰區組織海空力量全程跟監查證、依法警告驅離。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T12:07:58.952144+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":88,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T10:10:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T14:38:00.787786+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T12:05:51.958927+00:00","content_hash":"c2d340013da887dba9aee3d4b5c209c6f29ea844f79af366f6257a28061ba3ab","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}